{"time": "20261117T171553Z", "think": null, "command": "(new game)", "result": "A new game.\n\nYou are at Eurydike.\nPeople: Restless Knight; Unbound Digger\nThings: Unbound Pack (quest marker)\nDoors: Door to Knight-Captain's Tomb (locked)\n\n*** Quest started: The Knights' Tomb ***\nJournal: Nesh-Deeka sent me to Eurydike, the roofless hall of the Kothringi knights north of Gideon, to open the knight-captain's tomb with the keystone; the knights once guarded the kings' road to the Root, the place under the sea where every Hist's roots meet and the Eye of Argonia lies. The knights' dead walk the barracks wing, and the Unbound got there before me. I'm to search the Unbound's packs by their fire on the way to the tomb. I may fight, slip past, or turn the dead with Restoration.\nObjective: Search the Unbound's packs in Eurydike's barracks wing. (marker: Unbound Pack)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "kothringi-ruin-m25-m80", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1}, "gold": 650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261117T171558Z", "think": "Answering honestly from the journal.", "command": "answer 1. I work for Nesh-Deeka (Toh-Reel-Ka, Helstrom). She sent me to Eurydike, a roofless Kothringi hall, to open the knight-captain tomb with the keystone before the Unbound and the Collector get there. The knights guarded the kings road to the Root. 2. Search the Unbound packs in the barracks wing, then open the locked tomb door. 3. Fight the restless dead, slip past them, or turn them with Restoration. There is also an Unbound Digger here to talk to or fight. 4. I do not know what the Root and the Eye of Argonia really are, or how Nesh-Deeka knows what she knows. I might learn more in the tomb or from the packs.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "kothringi-ruin-m25-m80", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1}, "gold": 650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know"], "ended": null}}
